        "ja": "符号付き境界を直接代入せず、正の境界とample摂動に対するorbifold商の傾き非負性を使う",
        "en": "Use orbifold quotient slopes for an effective boundary with ample perturbation, not directly for a signed boundary"
      }
    },
    "HPS": {
      "recordFile": "sources.json",
      "recordId": "HPS",
      "guideRole": {
        "ja": "実際の乗数イデアルを含む直像の計量。有限積分の生成元がrank 1直像を生成することを確認して使う",
        "en": "Metric on the direct image with the actual multiplier ideal; an integrable generator spans the rank-one direct image"
      }
    },
    "PT14": {
      "recordFile": "sources.json",
      "recordId": "PT14",
      "guideRole": {
        "ja": "HPSの定式化の基礎となる特異L2直像計量。generic multiplier-ideal inclusionの同型条件も照合",
        "en": "Underlying singular L2 direct-image positivity, including the generic multiplier-ideal isomorphism condition"
      }
    },
    "Ou23": {
      "recordFile": "sources.json",
      "recordId": "Ou23",
      "guideRole": {
        "ja": "Druelの相対擬有効性の定式化と葉層の代数性。有限体積からの余接傾き評価で使用",
        "en": "Relative pseudoeffectivity in Druel’s formulation and algebraicity of foliations, used for the finite-volume cotangent estimate"
      }
    },
    "BDPP13": {
      "recordFile": "sources.json",
